  "details": "I have a big issue with my map.. everytime someone joins it, the guy that was before him is just getting his fps from 92 to 11 and stays there ( sometimes even crashing the game)\nAny ideea why this is happening?\nI played yesterday night with 4 friends and all worked well, i woke up in the morning ready to do more on the map then i invited someone and realise that is not working anymore.\nI didnt add any extra lights on the map\nJust 1-2 models from the unity store\nwich now i removed from the assets and the map\ni even removed the mirror\nand is still the same.\nFound out I am not the only one with this type of issue, one of my friends told me that even HUB has this problem.\nNot sure what is it, but as far as i can remember something like this happend when everything went \"down hill\": Currently in an older version of my map(private), finished uploading a new version of the map (still in the old one in the game), dropped a protal for the new version of the map, from here the map started to act weird as explained above.",
